<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Generador y corrector de exámenes (BYOK)</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sora:wght@400;600;700;800&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mammoth@1.13.0/mammoth.browser.min.js" integrity="sha384-8NWE3bZDrmRI4IePMoQaEoLhAQ1MmRMJkdNgnGiHRFanTqsFKr0TmK6aSZvFJ/PO" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/pdfjs-dist@3.11.174/build/pdf.js" integrity="sha384-nS3BSll1sd9HszmNsYkl4AckuUMs5BT9+jTal0AmkwkjxVDBaao4UkPCZDVM9tYv" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
